  "sources": [
    "Letter inventory and order (11 vowels; consonants ক…হ then ক্ষ ড় ঢ় য়): Wikipedia, \"Assamese alphabet\", vowel and consonant tables, read 2026-11-22. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assamese_alphabet",
    "ৎ ং ঃ ঁ: the same article lists ৎ (khanda ta) with the dentals and ং (anuxar), ঃ (bixarga), ঁ (chandrabindu) as separate groups, not in the consonant table. They are placed here at the end in group \"other\"; their position must be confirmed by the reviewer.",
    "Cross-check: Unicode CLDR common/main/as.xml exemplar characters (main/index/auxiliary) and native digits ০–৯, read 2026-11-22. https://github.com/unicode-org/cldr/blob/main/common/main/as.xml",
    "Vowel signs on ক (কা কি কী কু কূ কৃ কে কৈ কো কৌ): Wikipedia, \"Assamese alphabet\", vowel table.",
    "Not included (needs the reviewer): the urdho-comma vowel অʼ listed in the Wikipedia vowel table; number words; picture words.",
    "Asam Sahitya Sabha order could not be checked against a Sabha publication online: a native teacher must confirm the order before release."
  ]
